{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_EE148398","title":"Get help from Hanz","entry":"Dlg_EE148398::entry","exit":"Dlg_EE148398::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_6287E769","articyId":"72057645577636528","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hanz Grundown","text":"...Can I help you?","speakerId":"Ntt_13AFCC77","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"...Can I help you?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":525.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24117","byteOffset":17003696,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_D1907E11","articyId":"72057645577636738","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hanz Grundown","text":"Speak.","speakerId":"Ntt_13AFCC77","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Speak.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1125.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29436","byteOffset":19015344,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_C06925C7","articyId":"72057645577636759","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hanz Grundown","text":"As are we all. To some degree.","speakerId":"Ntt_13AFCC77","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"As are we all. To some degree.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1725.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49009","byteOffset":32881856,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_DBB54A46","articyId":"72057645577636766","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hanz Grundown","text":"You are just saying words. Do you have a request? An observation? An offer?","speakerId":"Ntt_13AFCC77","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You are just saying words. Do you have a request? An observation? An offer?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1725.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48822","byteOffset":32807880,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_211148A3","articyId":"72057645577636781","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hanz Grundown","text":"Really? Interesting.","speakerId":"Ntt_13AFCC77","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Really? Interesting.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2325.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35795","byteOffset":27888984,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_79C9A226","articyId":"72057645577636795","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hanz Grundown","text":"Slow down a little. I didn't say that. In fact, it would be easy enough to help you. Trivial even.","speakerId":"Ntt_13AFCC77","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Slow down a little. I didn't say that. In fact, it would be easy enough to help you. Trivial even.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2925.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49518","byteOffset":33075376,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_3E62DF88","articyId":"72057645577636809","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hanz Grundown","text":"From you? A favor. When I next ask you for help, be... amenable. You don't have to say yes. But if you say no, have a good reason. Are we clear?","speakerId":"Ntt_13AFCC77","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"From you? A favor. When I next ask you for help, be... amenable. You don't have to say yes. But if you say no, have a good reason. Are we clear?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3525.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45310","byteOffset":31475744,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_B1D8D9FD","articyId":"72057645577636840","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hanz Grundown","text":"No need. I'll make it easy. I'll talk to that new CorpSec overseer. The one who replaced Reoh. He's an old friend. I'll tell him to get the heavies to lay off Thad's protege.","speakerId":"Ntt_13AFCC77","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No need. I'll make it easy. I'll talk to that new CorpSec overseer. The one who replaced Reoh. He's an old friend. I'll tell him to get the heavies to lay off Thad's protege.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5000.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38446","byteOffset":28879088,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_CF5D699E","articyId":"72057645577636847","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hanz Grundown","text":"I'll make a call tonight. It's done.","speakerId":"Ntt_13AFCC77","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'll make a call tonight. It's done.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4425.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22298","byteOffset":16321536,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_EBD692F7","articyId":"72057645577636862","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hanz Grundown","text":"For me, certainly. These goons aren't even reporting up their own chain of command. They shouldn't be after you. They'll learn that tomorrow. CorpSec will squeeze their \"Boss.\" They'll feel the repercussion.","speakerId":"Ntt_13AFCC77","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"For me, certainly. These goons aren't even reporting up their own chain of command. They shouldn't be after you. They'll learn that tomorrow. CorpSec will squeeze their \"Boss.\" They'll feel the repercussion.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5600.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37027","byteOffset":28350472,"byteLength":552}},{"id":"DFr_F3EFBE65","articyId":"72057645577636883","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hanz Grundown","text":"Soon? Never? I really wouldn't worry about it. I won't.","speakerId":"Ntt_13AFCC77","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Soon? Never? I really wouldn't worry about it. I won't.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":6200.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28204","byteOffset":18552024,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_2D6F23FC","articyId":"72057645577636905","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Hanz Grundown's reputation is impeccable. I don't doubt he will ask a favor of you in the future - he keeps his promises - but if he says we are safe for now, we are.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hanz Grundown's reputation is impeccable. I don't doubt he will ask a favor of you in the future - he keeps his promises - but if he says we are safe for now, we are.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7100.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42904","byteOffset":30561224,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_016A17FB","articyId":"72057645577636919","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Yes. So let's keep things friendly with him.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes. So let's keep things friendly with him.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7700.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24364","byteOffset":17093288,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_02C91400","articyId":"72057645577636731","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I hope so.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I hope so.","TextSheVersion":"I hope so.","TextTheyVersion":"I hope so."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":825.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45533","byteOffset":31558272,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_39C606DA","articyId":"72057645577636745","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I am being extorted.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I am being extorted.","TextSheVersion":"I am being extorted.","TextTheyVersion":"I am being extorted."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40732","byteOffset":29737048,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_F781BA8E","articyId":"72057645577636752","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You have some CorpSec connections.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You have some CorpSec connections.","TextSheVersion":"You have some CorpSec connections.","TextTheyVersion":"You have some CorpSec connections."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37037","byteOffset":28354080,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_7B210445","articyId":"72057645577636773","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I need CorpSec protection from criminals. I thought you might know something about that.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I need CorpSec protection from criminals. I thought you might know something about that.","TextSheVersion":"I need CorpSec protection from criminals. I thought you might know something about that.","TextTheyVersion":"I need CorpSec protection from criminals. I thought you might know something about that."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2025.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30555","byteOffset":19439768,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_7169735B","articyId":"72057645577636788","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You're not going to help me are you?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're not going to help me are you?","TextSheVersion":"You're not going to help me are you?","TextTheyVersion":"You're not going to help me are you?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2625.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50763","byteOffset":33544136,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_E44861B9","articyId":"72057645577636802","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What do you want?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What do you want?","TextSheVersion":"What do you want?","TextTheyVersion":"What do you want?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3225.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31371","byteOffset":19748368,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_B795BAB2","articy